{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/720910-i-have-not-fouled-the-waters","id":720910,"title":"I have not fouled the waters.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-23T16:24:34-07:00","id":720910,"title":"I have not fouled the waters.","content":"Okay, so in brief my problem. I have come across a myth akin to Atlantis in which a city is drowned via divine wrath. It would be excellent if that could be worked into my campaign. To do this I have looked into the Negative Confessions of Maat, basically the 42 laws that each Judge presides over. The one most appropo is number 35, I have fouled (or stopped) no waters. To my consternation, none of the Judges described in Mummy are an obvious fit for this law and I despite my best efforts I haven't been able to piece it together through deduction or google either. Can any of you tell me which Judge I'm looking for here?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T06:22:04-07:00","id":722764,"title":"","content":"Hm. It depends on the interpretation of the negative confession. An-Afkh, the Judge of those who destroy Purity, or Kenemti, the Judge of those who profane what is holy, could work well if the waters are to be protected due to religious value.<br /> <br /> Alternatively, if you look at fouling/stopping the waters as a crime against a community (dependent on the water), then Neha-Hatu as Judge of those who violate the basic needs of another, or Am-Khaibit as Judge of those who commit crimes against humanity, would also be suitable choices.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}